Bind Npc 24435 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 14435 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 142 "Offering"
    Journal for karus "You have promised to bring Apples of Moradon to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."
    Journal for elmorad "You have promised to bring Apples of Moradon to [Moradon Merchant] Clark."
    Collect 10 of 810418000

Requires player level >= 40

Rewards
    Give 2000000 experience
    Give 110 of 900790000
    Give 80 of 900820000

direction_105 = location "Death Knight" about "Death Knight\nAn undead like the undying, possesses great strength as it is composed of powerful bone structure" found "Karus" karus at 1185 1220 in zone 1
direction_106 = location "Death Knight" about "Death Knight\nAn undead like the undying, possesses great strength as it is composed of powerful bone structure" found "El Morad" elmorad at 997 1024 in zone 2

On available
    If player is karus
        Say "Master! Merchant Shaimer seems to have good news, so let's go and find out^^"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Master! Merchant Clark seems to have good news, so let's go and find out^^"
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "There's a memorial service being held at Moradon Castle to give thanks for the peace, and they're buying all the Memorial Goods from our boss. Great news, eh?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "There is one small problem, though. A couple of Apples of Moradon were in route to Moradon for the memorial service, but heavy sand storms have seriously delayed their arrival. I can't just give up now, supplying these Memorial Goods is a huge honor for my family. I'm really up against it this time...\n\nThis opportunity won't come 'round again. I hope you come back in time with the stuff..."

On in_progress
    If player is karus
        Say "Yikes, what am I going to do, there isn't much time to prepare for the Memorial service!"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_105
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Yikes, what am I going to do, there isn't much time to prepare for the Memorial service!"
        Topic "Where can I find it?" do
            Map direction_106

On ready
    If player is karus
        Say "Really, there isn't much time left. Please rush to deliver them to Shaimer."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close
    If player is elmorad
        Say "Really, there isn't much time left. Please rush to deliver them to Clark."
        Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Nice~ Timing~~!! Thank you so much. I'm going to tell everyone how <selfname> saved the service! Heh."
